  "body": "Positioned on a generous 610m² freehold section and presented as the development's show home, this impressive brand-new home by Mars Living Construction offers approximately 228m² of thoughtfully designed family living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for growing and extended families, the flexible layout features 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and multiple living areas across two levels. A downstairs bedroom with its own ensuite is ideal for grandparents, guests, teenagers, or a private home office.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a separate family lounge opens seamlessly to the outdoor entertaining area and spacious backyard, creating a rare indoor-outdoor lifestyle that is increasingly difficult to find in modern new builds.\r\n\r\nYear-round comfort is assured with premium central air-conditioning featuring individual room controls, while underfloor heating adds extra comfort to the bathrooms.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\n• Approx. 228m² floor area\r\n• 610m² freehold section\r\n• 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms\r\n• Downstairs bedroom with ensuite\r\n• Multiple living areas\r\n• Upstairs lounge opening to backyard\r\n• Central air-conditioning with individual room controls\r\n• Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n• Bosch kitchen appliances\r\n• Double internal access garage\r\n• Quality construction by Mars Living Construction\r\n• Ready to move in\r\n\r\nOffering space, flexibility, and comfort in a sought-after Orewa location, this exceptional family home is ready for its new owners.\r\n\r\nContact Lisa today for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
